  <p id="c-jinshu-069-liune:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-069-liune:p001:m0000" ref="hnd_3at_h4i">隗</persName>伯父<persName id="c-jinshu-069-liune:p001:m0003" ref="j9x_82h_4t8">訥</persName>，字令言，有人倫鑒識。初入洛，見諸名士而歎曰：「<persName id="c-jinshu-069-liune:p001:m0028" ref="b0c_13f_c3a">王夷甫</persName>太鮮明，<persName id="c-jinshu-069-liune:p001:m0035" ref="591_360_8ca">樂彥輔</persName>我所敬，<persName id="c-jinshu-069-liune:p001:m0042" ref="1dq_vh2_eru">張茂先</persName>我所不解，<persName id="c-jinshu-069-liune:p001:m0050" ref="7c9_e07_973">周弘武</persName>巧於用短，<persName id="c-jinshu-069-liune:p001:m0058" ref="7eg_jgh_zgj">杜方叔</persName>拙于用長。」終於司隸校尉。</p>
</text>
